This is very common in compiling kernel modules.  Basically you need
some cflags from ther kernel's makefile (arch/alpha/Makefile).  In
2.4.18 this is:
    -mno-fp-regs -ffixed-8

I believe if you are smart you can just include this in your project's
Makefile.

